  triage:title "docs/project-plan.md Phase AX sprint status table still reads planned for AX.1-AX.6" ;
  triage:description "docs/project-plan.md section 55's 'Phase AX sprint status' table (lines ~1636-1642) shows Status = 'planned' for every row AX.1 through AX.6, directly contradicting the prose two lines above the table ('Current phase status: AX.1-AX.6 merged into integrate/phase-ax; AX.7 superseded 2026-09-05') and every corresponding sprint doc's own frontmatter (status: complete). Only the AX.7 row is correct (superseded). This is the same cross-doc staleness class as AXPE-QA-106/107/108, which fixed this exact table via PR #1238 on 2026-09-06; it reappeared afterward, most likely because the AW-sync merge (merge/develop-aw-into-phase-ax @ b788f6839, landed on integrate/phase-ax at 102d16f19 per Rand's direct-merge ruling) carried forward develop's older copy of this table over the fixed one. Remediation: change Status to complete (or merged) for AX.1-AX.6 rows, matching every sibling sprint doc." ;
